      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Came here looking for this. Instead of having to open the quick menu, accessing expressions, and toggling something, I want to be able to bind certain avatar features to the edge of the touchpad in the index controller or something like that. Seems obvious. Maybe have a list of \"custom user binding 1~X\" and assign them to specific controls in the avatar - for Button and Toggle controls at least.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
  ],
  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2020-07-12T02:13:35.874Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Some SteamVR controllers have a plethora of extra inputs that could be used for various purposes (eg, index controller touchpads, buttons, grip pressure sensors, etc). Having a way to plumb some of this through SteamVR into Avatar 3.0 to allow for non-menu-based controls for frequently used actions would be really nice. Simply having a couple 'user action' SteamVR binding actions that are linked to animation controller inputs would be a good start.",
